      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>I'm sorry, I don't really feel like talking to a professional. They just don't get it. They'll tell me it's just grief or that \"time heals all wounds,\" but time is just making everything feel heavier. It’s like I’m just waiting around for nothing. Everything feels so empty now that he's gone. It's not even sadness anymore, it's just... nothingness.",
